  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support &amp; strengthen the National Electoral Board of Ethiopia&#x2019;s electoral early warning system for the Seventh General Elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen electoral early warning and peacebuilding mechanisms by enhancing the technical capacity and deployment of election monitors and increasing public awareness of peace initiatives. This will be achieved through the development of standardized training resources, recruitment and training of monitors, and systematic nationwide and hotspot deployment to ensure timely incident reporting aligned with NEBE&#x2019;s traffic light system. Concurrently, the project will promote peaceful electoral participation through radio programs, capacity-building for civil society representatives on grassroots peacebuilding. These interventions seek to improve responsiveness to early warning signals, reduce electoral tensions, and foster inclusive, conflict-sensitive engagement across Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
